Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Evaluate a trimmed_mean over the full pool to see if a more robust aggregate beats the current best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","models":["catboost","CWT_catboost","DWT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_catboost","ONLY_DWT_rf","ONLY_FT_catboost","ONLY_FT_rf","ARIMA","ETS","THETA","NaiveMovingAverage","NaiveSeasonal"],"trim_pct":0.2}

